      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISCHIEF MATE (3) failed to come into contention last start after losing his position early at this track, but prior to that won by one length at this track (22.17) beating Mr. Kia Ora in a Special conditions Veteran race on September 10. Rates on top in this line up. ASTON FUMIKO (1) goes very well here starting 11 times for four wins and two minors. Missed the frame latest (22.74) when seventh over 390m at Ballarat in a Grade 5. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. ASTON CHANT (2) had some strong recent form but was below best last time when seventh (22.73) in a Grade 5 at Ballarat. Generally fast into stride but was shuffled back from the tricky draw last time. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Should play a prominent role. LEKTRA HARMONY (7) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
